{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14766","headline":"送浑链归觐却赴阙庭 · 卢纶","name":"送浑链归觐却赴阙庭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露幕拥簪裾，台庭饯伯鱼。\n彩衣人竞看，银诏帝亲书。\n知子当元老，爲臣饯二疎。\n执珪期已迫，捧膳步宁徐。\n而我诚愚者，夫君岂病诸。\n探题多决胜，馔玉每分余。\n荣比成功後，恩同造化初。\n甑尘方欲合，笼翮或将舒。\n榆荚钱难比，杨花雪不如。\n明朝古堤路，心断玉人车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}